sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Visa Intelligent Commerce link: token, passkey and instruction behind a TAP checkout
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: Visa Intelligent Commerce link: token, passkey and instruction behind a TAP checkout. 4 participants: Consumer, AI agent, Visa Intelligent Commerce, and Merchant. 7 steps, 7 crossing a trust boundary, 2 failure branches. Based on visa-tap TAP spec, unversioned (read 2026-10-11) (2025-10-14). Step 1: Consumer to AI agent: Ask the agent to add a card. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: AI agent to Visa Intelligent Commerce: POST /vacp/v1/cards. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Step-up fails: No token is provisioned. Step 3: AI agent to Visa Intelligent Commerce: POST /vacp/v1/instructions. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Consumer to Visa Intelligent Commerce: Approve with a passkey. This step crosses a trust boundary. If User declines: No credentials can be retrieved. Step 5: AI agent to Visa Intelligent Commerce: POST /vacp/v1/instructions/ instructionId /credentials. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 6: AI agent to Merchant: TAP checkout with the payment container. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 7: AI agent to Visa Intelligent Commerce: POST /vacp/v1/instructions/ instructionId /confirmations. This step crosses a trust boundary.
  autonumber
  participant p_user as Consumer
  participant p_agent as AI agent
  participant p_vic as Visa Intelligent Commerce
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  p_user->>p_agent: Ask the agent to add a card
  Note over p_user,p_agent: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_agent->>p_vic: POST /vacp/v1/cards
    Note over p_agent,p_vic: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Step-up fails
    Note over p_agent,p_vic: No token is provisioned
  end
  p_agent->>p_vic: POST /vacp/v1/instructions
  Note over p_agent,p_vic: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_user->>p_vic: Approve with a passkey
    Note over p_user,p_vic: Crosses a trust boundary
  else User declines
    Note over p_user,p_vic: No credentials can be retrieved
  end
  p_agent->>p_vic: POST /vacp/v1/instructions/#123;instructionId#125;/credentials
  Note over p_agent,p_vic: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_agent->>p_merchant: TAP checkout with the payment container
  Note over p_agent,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_agent->>p_vic: POST /vacp/v1/instructions/#123;instructionId#125;/confirmations
  Note over p_agent,p_vic: Crosses a trust boundary
